# .NET build output
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
*.user

# published single-file artifacts (built by CI / release, not committed)
publish/

# local embedded SQLite databases
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# design-system generated dist is CHECKED IN as the reference seed until the
# Style Dictionary pipeline lands (see design-system/scripts/build.md), so it is
# intentionally NOT ignored here.

# node (design-system tooling / the SPA)
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
web/.vite/

# The built SPA (web/ → src/UsageTracker.Ingestion.Api/wwwroot) is CHECKED IN as the
# reference bundle so `dotnet publish` embeds the UI with no Node toolchain on the
# build/CI host (same rationale as design-system/dist). Rebuild with `npm run build`
# in web/. It is intentionally NOT ignored.

# local env / secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
*.log
